  <xs:complexType name="t_upload">
    <xs:annotation>
      <xs:documentation xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[<p>Allows uploads from the user's computer or device. The component is added to the view ahead of time so the browser can show the appropriate upload dialog once triggered; use hide="true" to keep it invisible, otherwise it expands and shows progress bars. Drive it from a process with callMethod: setDestination to set the target folder, then uploadStart. Requires panel as parent.</p><p>In the view:</p><pre><code>&lt;panel&gt;<br/>&#32;&#32;&lt;upload name="up" hide="true" camera="true"/&gt;<br/>&#32;&#32;&lt;button name="go" text="Upload"/&gt;<br/>&lt;/panel&gt;</code></pre><p>In the process:</p><pre><code>&lt;operation name="callMethod" value="#upload#up"&gt;<br/>&#32;&#32;&lt;method name="setDestination"&gt;<br/>&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&lt;param&gt;home://&lt;/param&gt;<br/>&#32;&#32;&lt;/method&gt;<br/>&lt;/operation&gt;</code></pre>]]></xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:attributeGroup ref="t_inlineComponent"/>
    <xs:attribute name="camera" type="t_flag">
      <xs:annotation>
        <xs:documentation xml:lang="en">Requests the camera to be used. Requires filename to be set.</xs:documentation>
      </xs:annotation>
    </xs:attribute>
    <xs:attribute name="overwrite" type="t_flag">
      <xs:annotation>
        <xs:documentation xml:lang="en">Overwrites any file with the same file name in the target folder.</xs:documentation>
      </xs:annotation>
    </xs:attribute>
    <xs:attribute name="silent" type="t_flag">
      <xs:annotation>
        <xs:documentation xml:lang="en">Stops upload error pop-ups from showing when something went wrong.</xs:documentation>
      </xs:annotation>
    </xs:attribute>
    <xs:attribute name="style" type="xs:string">
      <xs:annotation>
        <xs:documentation xml:lang="en">Overrides the component's default style</xs:documentation>
      </xs:annotation>
    </xs:attribute>
    <!-- The l: localisation twins and the xlink attributes components carry for
